 "sp.confirm": {
  "text": "Replace the single episodes of this season with the season pack?\n\n1. Sonarr downloads the pack (the episodes stay as they are meanwhile).\n2. When it is 100% done and holds every episode you have, the season is unmonitored and its files are DELETED in Sonarr.\n3. Sonarr imports the pack; then monitoring is restored and the single-episode torrents are moved to the trash folder.\n\nIt runs in the background; if something goes wrong before step 2 nothing is changed.",
  "note": "confirmation box. Keep the line breaks and the numbering."
 },
